abstract: >-
  Weekly EU Weekly Oil Bulletin panel (2005-01-03 onwards, European Commission data, CC BY 4.0) with the Commission's EU27 and
  euro-area weighted averages, and daily national and regional fuel price statistics computed by fuel-prices.eu from official
  national station feeds (our statistics CC BY 4.0; the underlying source data keep their own terms, see README-d2.md).
